{"entries":[{"id":"ethanmollick-30-months-on-the-exponential-in-charts","sourceId":"ethanmollick","sourceName":"伊桑·莫利克 · One Useful Thing","title":"30 Months on the Exponential (in Charts)","titleZh":"指数增长中的 30 个月（图表版）","published":"2026-10-20T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1792454400000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/ethanmollick-30-months-on-the-exponential-in-charts/","image":"","summary":"AI capabilities have advanced exponentially but unevenly over 30 months, shifting human-AI collaboration from chatbot centaur/cyborg models toward a conjurer model of summoning and evaluating agents, while humans retain advantage through deep knowledge, wide knowledge, taste, and agency.","summaryZh":"过去 30 个月 AI 能力呈指数级但不均衡增长，人机协作从聊天机器人式的半人马/赛博格模式转向召唤并评估智能体的魔法师模式，而人类仍凭深度知识、广度知识、品味与能动性保持优势。"},{"id":"ethanmollick-the-dot-and-the-swarm","sourceId":"ethanmollick","sourceName":"伊桑·莫利克 · One Useful Thing","title":"The Dot and the Swarm","titleZh":"点与群","published":"2026-10-01T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1790812800000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/ethanmollick-the-dot-and-the-swarm/","image":"","summary":"Organizing AI agents is no longer the hard part—coordination emerges from better models, not human scaffolding, and cheap organization may create more work for people, not less.","summaryZh":"组织 AI 智能体已不再是难点——协调能力源于更好的模型而非人类搭建的框架，而廉价的组织成本可能为人类创造更多工作，而非更少。"},{"id":"ethanmollick-the-overhang","sourceId":"ethanmollick","sourceName":"伊桑·莫利克 · One Useful Thing","title":"The Overhang","titleZh":"能力悬垂","published":"2026-09-18T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1789689600000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/ethanmollick-the-overhang/","image":"","summary":"AI capabilities already far outpace human systems and adoption, so people should stop competing on output and instead leverage deep knowledge, wide knowledge, taste, and agency to build collaborative human-AI models.","summaryZh":"AI 能力已远超人类系统与采用速度，人们不应在产出上与之竞争，而应发挥深度知识、广度知识、品味与能动性这四大人类优势，构建增强而非替代人类劳动的协作模式。"},{"id":"etha